  "text": "Anyone can change it. So why isn't it a mess? Ten rules, written down, that anyone can read. No ads. No links out. Nothing hidden. Keep it working on a phone. Ask it to plug your startup and it says no, and tells you why. Big asks go to a vote. Every three hours, the most wanted one gets built. There is no human in the loop. There's a rulebook, a judge, and a sandbox.",
